SUMMARY:Author Talk: Carlton Champion - Notes to My Father
LOCATION:Adams Street Library\, 690 Adams Street\, Dorchester\, MA 02122
DESCRIPTION:Join Boston author Carlton Champian for a reading and conversat
 ion centered on Notes to My Father\, a personal collection exploring fathe
 rhood\, absence\, grief\, and healing. Participants can expect heartfelt s
 torytelling\, space for reflection and discussion\, and an opportunity to 
 write a letter of their own. Sharing is optional.\nhttps://bpl.bibliocommo
 ns.com/events/6aee234e9dbc2b002c93d361\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushp
